sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>(data-science-gateway)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (service-ca)
    participant K8sAuth as K8s API Server<br/>(TokenReview + SAR)<br/>6443/TCP
    participant Dashboard as odh-dashboard<br/>(Node.js BFF)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GenAI as gen-ai BFF<br/>8143/TCP HTTPS
    participant MaaS as maas BFF<br/>8243/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as mlflow BFF<br/>8343/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as K8s API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 1: User Accesses Dashboard UI

    Browser->>Gateway: GET /<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>KRBAC: Forward<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS (service-ca)
    KRBAC->>K8sAuth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAuth-->>KRBAC: Auth result (can list projects?)
    KRBAC->>Dashboard: Forward with auth headers<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>X-Auth-Request-User<br/>X-Auth-Request-Groups
    Dashboard-->>KRBAC: React SPA + static assets
    KRBAC-->>Gateway: HTTPS response
    Gateway-->>Browser: Dashboard UI<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 2: BFF Module API Call (Sidecar Mode)

    Browser->>KRBAC: POST /gen-ai/api/chat<br/>HTTPS/8443<br/>Bearer token
    KRBAC->>Dashboard: Forward<br/>HTTP/8080<br/>X-Auth-Request-User header
    Dashboard->>GenAI: Proxy to module<br/>HTTPS/8143<br/>x-forwarded-access-token header<br/>TLS (shared serving cert)
    GenAI->>K8sAPI: K8s API call<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>User token (impersonation)
    K8sAPI-->>GenAI: K8s response
    GenAI-->>Dashboard: API response
    Dashboard-->>KRBAC: Response
    KRBAC-->>Browser: JSON response<br/>HTTPS/8443

    Note over Browser,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Inter-Module Communication (Gen AI -> MaaS)

    GenAI->>MaaS: Model endpoint discovery<br/>HTTPS/8243<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token (user token passthrough)
    MaaS->>K8sAPI: K8s API call<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>User token (impersonation)
    K8sAPI-->>MaaS: Model endpoints
    MaaS-->>GenAI: Model catalog response

    GenAI->>MLflow: Experiment tracking<br/>HTTPS/8343<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)<br/>x-forwarded-access-token
    MLflow->>K8sAPI: K8s API call<br/>HTTPS/6443<br/>User token (impersonation)
    K8sAPI-->>MLflow: Experiment data
    MLflow-->>GenAI: Experiment response
